# Wabi — Complete Project Documentation

## 🎯 Project Overview

**Wabi** is a **free, self-hosted communication platform** designed for users who want Discord-like functionality without technical expertise. It combines:

- **Discord-style** server/channel community structure
- **TeamSpeak-inspired** reliable voice/video calls
- **LINE-style** social/group messaging UX
- **Full self-hosting** — communities control their own data

**Core Philosophy**: "No spying. No bloat. Just chill." — Privacy-first, ephemeral-by-default, minimal complexity.

**License**: MIT  
**Current Version**: 0.1.0 (Rust workspace), 1.0.0 (frontend/backend packages)  
**Rust Edition**: 2021, **rust-version**: 1.88

