## 🔌 Addon Architecture ("Blender for Chat")

### Principles
- **Core is minimal**: Text, voice, DMs, calls only
- **Addons are optional**: Server operators choose what to enable
- **Local-first**: Data lives on user device; server storage opt-in
- **P2P first**: Payments/files flow directly; Wabi is infrastructure
- **Rust where it matters**: Performance/safety-critical paths

### Addon Categories
| Category | Addons |
|----------|--------|
| **Media** | screen-share, albums, maps |
| **Content** | reader-mode, 3d-viewer, youtube-sync, spotify-sync |
| **Payments** | payments-core (Rust), payments-bitcoin, payments-thailand, payments-psp |
| **Compliance** | server-auditor (archival, retention, export) |
| **Infrastructure** | webhooks (Rust), mesh (multi-node sync) |

### Manifest (`plugin.json`)
```json
{
  "id": "payments-bitcoin",
  "dependsOn": ["payments-core"],
  "permissions": ["payments:intent:create", "user:settings:write"],
  "security": { "threatNotes": "Non-custodial only...", "networkAccess": ["outbound:bitcoin-adapter.example.com"] },
  "backend": { "language": "typescript", "entry": "./backend/index.ts", "runtime": "node20" },
  "frontend": { "entry": "./frontend/BitcoinSettings.svelte", "mountPoint": "settings/payments" },
  "integrity": { "algorithm": "sha256", "checksum": "..." },
  "signer": { "keyId": "ed25519:...", "publicKey": "...", "algorithm": "ed25519" }
}
```

