## 🚀 Deployment

### Quick Start (Docker)
```bash
git clone https://github.com/AzureFoxStudios/wabi.git
cd wabi
docker compose up -d --build
# Frontend: http://localhost:3000
# Backend:  http://localhost:8080
# Health:   http://localhost:8080/health
```

### Compose Profiles
| Profile | Services |
|---------|----------|
| (default) | spacetimedb, stdb-publisher, stdb-proxy, wabi-server |
| `turn` | coturn (TURN REST auth) |
| `tunnel` + `tunnel-quick` | cloudflared quick tunnel (*.trycloudflare.com) |
| `tunnel` + `tunnel-named` | cloudflared named tunnel (your domain) |
| `srt-gateway` | media-gateway (SRT daemon) |
| `sfu` | livekit (WebRTC SFU) |
| `booster-full` | turn + sfu + srt-gateway |

### Guided Setup
```bash
./scripts/setup.sh           # Linux/macOS interactive wizard
./scripts/setup-forWindows.ps1  # Windows (no WSL)
```

