## 🛡️ Privacy & Security

- **Zero persistence by default**: All data in RAM + client IndexedDB; lost on restart
- **Optional logging**: `ENABLE_LOGGING=false` default; opt-in only
- **No metadata leaks**: No IP logging, connection history, activity graphs
- **JWT auth**: Self-contained tokens, 7-day expiry, HTTPS required in prod
- **File privacy**: Auto-deletion on message delete; no orphaned files
- **Self-hosted**: Operator owns server, controls data
- **Open source**: No hidden tracking

